#Swildons Hole, Priddy, Mendip, Somerset, UK
#Resurvey Project. Lead by Paul 'Footleg' Fretwell, Jun. 2013 - Jul. 2016
#Plan Maps for Entrance Series

# (input statements for drawings are in the corresponding centreline data .th files)

join LongDryWaySP1@Swildons ShortDryWaySP1@ShortDryWay.Swildons
join KenneysSP1@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons LongDryWaySP1@Swildons
join KenneysSP1@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons BaptismCrawlSP1@ShowerbathArea.Swildons
join ShortDryWaySP1@ShortDryWay.Swildons BaptismCrawlSP1@ShowerbathArea.Swildons
join ShortDryWaySP3@ShortDryWay.Swildons ShortDryWaySP2@Swildons
join EntranceSP2@Swildons ShowerbathSP1@ShowerbathArea.Swildons
join KenneysSP2@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons ShowerbathSP3@ShowerbathArea.Swildons
join ShowerbathSP4@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons ShowerbathSP3@ShowerbathArea.Swildons
join KenneysSP2@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons UpperOxbowSP1@Swildons
join KenneysSP2@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons WetWaySP1@Swildons
join KenneysSP2@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons WetWaySP2@Swildons
join ButcombeChamberSP1@ButcombeOxbows.Swildons UpperOxbowSP2@Swildons
join OldGrottoStreamSP2@Swildons WaterChamberSP1@WaterChamber.Swildons
join WetWaySP4@Swildons WetWaySP5@WaterChamber.Swildons

map EntranceSeriesPlan -title "Swildons Hole - Entrance Series"
#  elevfixSP@Swildons
  ButcombeChamberSP1@ButcombeOxbows.Swildons
  LongDryWaySP4@Swildons
    break
  EntranceSP1@Swildons
  EntranceSP2@Swildons
  LongDryWaySP3@Swildons
  LongDryWaySP1@Swildons
  LongDryWaySP2@Swildons
  KenneysSP2@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons
  KenneysSP1@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons
  WetWaySP3@Swildons
  WetWaySP2@Swildons
  WetWaySP1@Swildons
    break
  UpperOxbowSP4@Swildons
  UpperOxbowSP3@Swildons
  UpperOxbowSP2@Swildons
  UpperOxbowSP1@Swildons
  DryWayStreamSP1@Swildons
  ShowerbathSP1@ShowerbathArea.Swildons
    break
  ShowerbathSP2@ShowerbathArea.Swildons
  ShowerbathSP3@ShowerbathArea.Swildons
  ShowerbathSP4@KenneysDigToShowerbath.Swildons
    break
  DryWayStreamSP2@Swildons
  LongDryWaySP5@Swildons
  NewGrottoesSP1@Swildons
  BoulderChamberSP1@Swildons
  BoulderChamberSP2@Swildons
  ShortDryWaySP1@ShortDryWay.Swildons
  ShortDryWaySP2@ShortDryWay.Swildons
  ShortDryWaySP3@ShortDryWay.Swildons
  BaptismCrawlSP1@ShowerbathArea.Swildons
  OldGrottoSP1@Swildons
  ShortDryWaySP2@Swildons
    break
  OldGrottoStreamSP3@Swildons
  OldGrottoStreamSP2@Swildons
  OldGrottoStreamSP1@Swildons
  WetWaySP4@Swildons
  WetWaySP5@WaterChamber.Swildons
  WetWaySP6@WaterChamber.Swildons
  WaterChamberSP2@WaterChamber.Swildons
  WaterChamberSP1@WaterChamber.Swildons
endmap

